npc_10112_dialogue_2_1=This pet refuses to let you pass, looks like you've got to find another way
npc_10113_dialogue_2_1=This pet refuses to let you pass, looks like you've got to find another way
npc_10101_dialogue_3_1=You have picked a great partner. Now let's familiarize you with pet battles
npc_10105_dialogue_3_1=You have picked a great partner. Now let's familiarize you with pet battles
npc_10108_dialogue_3_1=Fighting will stimulate the incredible energy in the pet. Let's have a battle and I will show you
npc_20101_dialogue_3_1=Pay attention when you are in the wild, I will test you
npc_20102_dialogue_3_1=Your pet looks so strong! Come and fight with my pet!
npc_20103_dialogue_3_1=My battle is rhythmic like a song. Come now, let's waltz
npc_20104_dialogue_3_1=Hi, can you have battle with me?
npc_20105_dialogue_3_1=Huh! I am in charge here. Don't leave!
npc_20106_dialogue_3_1=Hey you, stop! You look really suspicious, you must be that thief! I will arrest you! ! !
npc_20107_dialogue_3_1=Hahahaha, it turned out that my sister wronged you.\n You must be really good if you can beat my sister, so come and battle with me.
npc_20108_dialogue_3_1=Why does your pet look so strong! Humph, common people like you don't deserve to have such a good pet! Give your pet to me!
npc_20109_dialogue_3_1=Hey! you! Yes, you! You looks like a passing traveler.\nYou must get my permission if you want to pass here
npc_20201_dialogue_3_1=Young people must be passionate! Come, have a passionate duel with me!
npc_20202_dialogue_3_1=Hi, I am a researcher and I am conducting a study that may change the world. Now, I order you in the name of science to cooperate with my experiment and fight with me.
npc_20203_dialogue_3_1=You are not allowed to bully my brother! ! My partner, come out and fight him! !
npc_20204_dialogue_3_1=Let me test the result of my new study!
npc_20205_dialogue_3_1=If you want to move forward you gotta prove yourself!
npc_20206_dialogue_3_1=...
npc_20401_dialogue_3_1=Will you enter the gym?
npc_20301_dialogue_3_1=You must beat me before you can go on
npc_20302_dialogue_3_1=Hahaha, it's been a long time since a challenger came. My pets can't wait to fight your pets.
npc_20303_dialogue_3_1=You are great, but that's it.
npc_20304_dialogue_3_1=Wow! I didn't expect you to fight your way here. \nGood, you are exactly the person that I hoped to fight againts, now come on!
npc_20305_dialogue_3_1=Let me end your journey here!
npc_20306_dialogue_3_1=You will meet the gym leader if you win me, come on.
npc_20307_dialogue_3_1=I am the gym leader, let's start the trial!
npc_10101_dialogue_2_4=There are many magical pet with different abilities in this world. Go on and collect more pets!
npc_10105_dialogue_2_4=You are doing well, keep moving forward.
npc_10108_dialogue_2_4=There are many magical pet with different abilities in this world. Go on and collect more pets!
npc_20101_dialogue_2_4=You reached the standard, go ahead then
npc_20102_dialogue_2_4=Ok! You are really good, keep working hard.
npc_20103_dialogue_2_4=Young travelers, may the goddess bless you.
npc_20104_dialogue_2_4=Wow! You are amazing
npc_20105_dialogue_2_4=Whoops, oh..sorry young traveler, I was wrong.
npc_20106_dialogue_2_4=You are so powerful, I accept my loss.
npc_20107_dialogue_2_4=You... just you wait! My brother will not let you off for angering me!
npc_20108_dialogue_2_4=Oh... curses. How could a commoner defeat me?
npc_20109_dialogue_2_4=To think I was defeated... I recognize your strength now. \nJust speak my name, and no one will dare to trouble you in this town.
npc_20201_dialogue_2_4=Wa hahaha! I am high-spirited and passionate even in defeat
npc_20202_dialogue_2_4=Oh, a star just fell to the ground...
npc_20203_dialogue_2_4=My brother used to be the best researcher in the Meteor Town, but... why does everyone bully my brother.
npc_20204_dialogue_2_4=More research is needed. . . do not bother me.
npc_20205_dialogue_2_4=I lost, move forward!
npc_20206_dialogue_2_4=...Go away
npc_20402_dialogue_2_4=Will you leave the gym?
npc_20301_dialogue_2_4=You won, continue your journey
npc_20302_dialogue_2_4=Well, you are a really great pet trainer, go ahead.
npc_20303_dialogue_2_4=I am thoroughly defeated
npc_20304_dialogue_2_4=You are indeed the one that I expected, keep going forward!!
npc_20305_dialogue_2_4=I really need to train myself harder.
npc_20306_dialogue_2_4=Go on! I am sure you can defeat the gym leader! !
npc_20307_dialogue_2_4=You won, please accept the gym badge
npc_20301_dialogue_3=You need to defeat the gym trainer standing in front of me first, then you can challenge me
npc_20302_dialogue_3=You need to defeat the gym trainer standing in front of me first, then you can challenge me
npc_20303_dialogue_3=You need to defeat the gym trainer standing in front of me first, then you can challenge me
npc_20304_dialogue_3=You need to defeat the gym trainer standing in front of me first, then you can challenge me
npc_20305_dialogue_3=You need to defeat the gym trainer standing in front of me first, then you can challenge me
npc_20306_dialogue_3=You need to defeat the gym trainer standing in front of me first, then you can challenge me
npc_20307_dialogue_3=You need to defeat the all gym trainers standing in front of me first, then you can challenge me
npc_30101_dialogue_3_1=You are such a beast! Let's fight!
npc_30102_dialogue_3_1=Let's have a wonderful battle!
npc_30103_dialogue_3_1=If you want to move forward you gotta prove yourself!
npc_30104_dialogue_3_1=...
npc_30105_dialogue_3_1=Let's have a joyful pet battle!
npc_30106_dialogue_3_1=Bring it on!
npc_30107_dialogue_3_1=Please show your pass.
npc_30108_dialogue_3_1=It's really dangerous ahead, let me test how strong you are!
npc_30109_dialogue_3_1=Let me test the result of my new study!
npc_30201_dialogue_3_1=Your pet is so pretty! Can I paint a portrait of it?
npc_30202_dialogue_3_1=The weather is really nice today!
npc_30112_dialogue_3_1=Let me see if you're good enough to move forward!
npc_30101_dialogue_2_4=Tap out! Tap out!
npc_30102_dialogue_2_4=I guess you are a little stronger than me now, go ahead and move forward.
npc_30103_dialogue_2_4=I lost, move forward!
npc_30104_dialogue_2_4=...Go away
npc_30105_dialogue_2_4=Have a wonderful trip!
npc_30106_dialogue_2_4=You are a lot stronger than me I guess, hope we can meet again some day.
npc_30107_dialogue_2_4=Turned out to be another trainer, it was a misunderstanding.
npc_30108_dialogue_2_4=It seems that you can protect yourself from danger, feel free to move on.
npc_30109_dialogue_2_4=More research is needed. . . do not bother me.
npc_30201_dialogue_2_4=I will send it to you when I'm done, so go ahead and continue your adventure.
npc_30202_dialogue_2_4=It seems that you have trained your pet well.
npc_30112_dialogue_2_4=The next opponent will be stronger, be careful.
npc_40101_dialogue_3_1=Welcome to Windbell valley
npc_40102_dialogue_3_1=You want some donut?
npc_40103_dialogue_3_1=Come play with me!
npc_40104_dialogue_3_1=Don't even thing about passing here!
npc_40105_dialogue_3_1=What are you doing sneaking around behind the gym?
npc_40106_dialogue_3_1=Have you seen any rare rocks?
npc_40107_dialogue_3_1=Do you know the way to the gym?
npc_40108_dialogue_3_1=Do you want an epic pet fight?
npc_40109_dialogue_3_1=Do not destroy the forest!
npc_40201_dialogue_3_1=You seem really strong huh? Let's battle.
npc_90111_dialogue_3_1=I hear that people can get inspiration from battles, you wanna battle?
npc_40111_dialogue_3_1=The gym isn't opened yet. Please come again next time.
npc_40202_dialogue_3_1=It's a danger zone ahead, are you sure you want to move forward?
npc_40101_dialogue_2_4=Have a wonderful trip!
npc_40102_dialogue_2_4=I guess baking is more suitable for me.
npc_40103_dialogue_2_4=Wah, you are bullying me.
npc_40104_dialogue_2_4=If you can't win, run! I'm outta here!
npc_40105_dialogue_2_4=Misunderstanding! It's all a misunderstanding!
npc_40106_dialogue_2_4=You must contact me if you have seen some rare ores.
npc_40107_dialogue_2_4=Thank you for giving me directions. I didn't even realise that I was already at the doorstep
npc_40108_dialogue_2_4=Hahahahaha keep going!
npc_40109_dialogue_2_4=Remember to protect the environment!
npc_40201_dialogue_2_4=Young people don’t know how to respect the elderly nowadays
npc_90111_dialogue_2_4=I guess sculpting is more suitable for me.
npc_40111_dialogue_2_4=The gym isn't opened yet. Please come again next time.
npc_40202_dialogue_2_4=Seems like you are able to protect yourself now, move on trainer.
npc_50101_dialogue_3_1=Starfall valley was a meteor crater before, and I heard that it's the source of pets’ magical powers
npc_50102_dialogue_3_1=This little town is so unique!
npc_50103_dialogue_3_1=Have you seen my bro? He is also a researcher.
npc_50104_dialogue_3_1=Camping is really interesting, we can camp together next time!
npc_50105_dialogue_3_1=After retiring as a champion, it's been a long time since I last battled someone
npc_50106_dialogue_3_1=I heard that there are valuable treasures here worth exploring for
npc_50107_dialogue_3_1=There are many legends about this place
npc_50108_dialogue_3_1=This mountain is mine! No entry!
npc_50109_dialogue_3_1=Come and have a pet battle with me!
npc_50201_dialogue_3_1=Be careful, there are many things worth investigating in this area.
npc_50202_dialogue_3_1=There seem to be some problems with your training? Let me guide you.
npc_50112_dialogue_3_1=The ruins in front are very dangerous, I want to make sure you are strong enough.
npc_50101_dialogue_2_4=As expected of a trainer who can make it here, you sure are a strong one.
npc_50102_dialogue_2_4=You are really powerful to be able to defeat my special pet
npc_50103_dialogue_2_4=Is he actually so far away? Thank you.
npc_50104_dialogue_2_4=Such a dangerous place is not suitable for camping...? It's obviously more exciting this way!
npc_50105_dialogue_2_4=Fortunately, I have retired. Are young people all so strong now?
npc_50106_dialogue_2_4=Treasures that cannot be found are just a waste of time, goodbye.
npc_50107_dialogue_2_4=Professional trainers are different indeed. Let me interview you if I have the opportunity.
npc_50108_dialogue_2_4=I was wrong! I dare not to challenge you next time!
npc_50109_dialogue_2_4=Next time, I will definitely not lose
npc_50201_dialogue_2_4=I'm going to continue my investigation, be careful when you move around.
npc_50202_dialogue_2_4=Is my method wrong? I will definitely not lose next time!
npc_50112_dialogue_2_4=You are strong and qualified to continue exploring.
