npc_70101_dialogue_3_1=Welcome to the Flame Shrine. Please start your challenge.
npc_70102_dialogue_3_1=The elegant me shall accept your challenge.
npc_70103_dialogue_3_1=I'm so hungry... Come, let's fight quickly so I can go and eat soon.
npc_70104_dialogue_3_1=It's been a long time since someone came to challenge the Flame Shrine.
npc_70105_dialogue_3_1=Oh, what do you think if I sold souvenirs at the entrance of the shrine?
npc_70106_dialogue_3_1=Burp...H..hi, chaaa..challenger
npc_70107_dialogue_3_1=Challenges are like sailing against the current.
npc_70108_dialogue_3_1=Hey, I have heard of you, come here, let's battle.
npc_70109_dialogue_3_1=Oh, it's you. Well, you have made an appointment to fight, let's start.
npc_70110_dialogue_3_1=The leader has orders, you need to defeat me to continue to challenge.
npc_70111_dialogue_3_1=I will go all out for every challenge, bring it on!
npc_70112_dialogue_3_1=Here is your final challenge, start your challenge when you are ready.
npc_70201_dialogue_3_1=Hello, little cutie pie, I accept your challenge.
npc_70202_dialogue_3_1=Hahaha, you actually defeated everyone before me, kid you are very good.
npc_70203_dialogue_3_1=My pets are so cute, how about yours?
npc_70204_dialogue_3_1=Ah... I'm sorry, I got distracted, um, let's start your challenge.
npc_70205_dialogue_3_1=Hello, are you ready to challenge me?
npc_70206_dialogue_3_1=Are you ready to challenge me?
npc_70207_dialogue_3_1=I am vice leader Downey, I accept your challenge.
npc_70208_dialogue_3_1=Come, start your challenge like a man.
npc_70209_dialogue_3_1=I will go all out for every challenge, bring it on!
npc_70210_dialogue_3_1=Greetings challenger.
npc_70211_dialogue_3_1=On behalf of Grass Shrine, I accept your challenge.
npc_70212_dialogue_3_1=Here is your final challenge, start your challenge when you are ready.
npc_70301_dialogue_3_1=Are you ready to challenge me?
npc_70302_dialogue_3_1=Every challenge should be elegant.
npc_70303_dialogue_3_1=Calmness and determination are the only way to win the battle.
npc_70304_dialogue_3_1=Don't talk no more and start your challenge.
npc_70305_dialogue_3_1=I am bored, maybe battling with you will entertain me.
npc_70306_dialogue_3_1=Your pets all look weak? Can you beat me?
npc_70307_dialogue_3_1=If you can beat the person before me, it means that you are quite strong. I'll have to go all out then.
npc_70308_dialogue_3_1=The challenge begins!
npc_70309_dialogue_3_1=Phew...you are finally here, come on, let's start the challenge.
npc_70310_dialogue_3_1=I have heard your story, how about giving me an autograph after you the battle?
npc_70311_dialogue_3_1=I am the co-founder Phily. On behalf of Flowing Water Church, I accept your challenge.
npc_70312_dialogue_3_1=Here is your final challenge, start your challenge when you are ready.
npc_70401_dialogue_3_1=The shrine challenge begins, let's start.
npc_70402_dialogue_3_1=Interesting, your pet is interesting, I accept your challenge.
npc_70403_dialogue_3_1=Wait a moment, I will register first and the challenge can right after.
npc_70404_dialogue_3_1=Your pets all look weak? Can you beat me?
npc_70405_dialogue_3_1=I've been practicing here for a long time, you want to try me?
npc_70406_dialogue_3_1=If you want to continue to challenge, you have to beat me.
npc_70407_dialogue_3_1=If you can beat the person before me, it means that you are quite strong. I'll have to go all out then.
npc_70408_dialogue_3_1=You...Hello. Woo, why do you challenge at this time? I haven't finished eating yet, wait a moment.
npc_70409_dialogue_3_1=I want to keep training myself in the battle, come on!
npc_70410_dialogue_3_1=Woo, hello zzZ...oh! Are you here to challenge? Okay, hurry up, I have to go to bed after the fight.
npc_70411_dialogue_3_1=I'm invincible!
npc_70412_dialogue_3_1=Here is your final challenge, start your challenge when you are ready.
npc_70101_dialogue_2_4=Ignite your fighting spirit!
npc_70102_dialogue_2_4=Keep chasing the green flame on your way forward!
npc_70103_dialogue_2_4=Maybe you will beat me once, but you will never defeat me.
npc_70104_dialogue_2_4=The brilliance of the Flame Temple will continue to guide me forward.
npc_70105_dialogue_2_4=Oh? Wow, you are great, let's play together.
npc_70106_dialogue_2_4=Humph, you can only beat me anyway.
npc_70107_dialogue_2_4=The spirit of flames is shapeless but full of power.
npc_70108_dialogue_2_4=I will make a serious analysis of this failure.
npc_70109_dialogue_2_4=Yes... I'm sorry... I am not good at battling.
npc_70110_dialogue_2_4=Hey there! Looks like I should quit my job and go out to start my adventure
npc_70111_dialogue_2_4=I see fiery courage in your eyes, move on
npc_70112_dialogue_2_4=Your name will be engraved in the shrine by me.
npc_70201_dialogue_2_4=Challenges are like sailing against the current.
npc_70202_dialogue_2_4=Your challenge is like the creation of the ancient gods, let's create miracles.
npc_70203_dialogue_2_4=Your challenge is like the creation of the ancient gods, let's create miracles.
npc_70204_dialogue_2_4=Hey there! you are great.
npc_70205_dialogue_2_4=If you beat me, just keep going, don't keep hanging around here.
npc_70206_dialogue_2_4=My defeat was part of the plan.
npc_70207_dialogue_2_4=Oh my goodness, the data from this failure is extremely precious.
npc_70208_dialogue_2_4=Flow like water and continue to advance.
npc_70209_dialogue_2_4=Quickly restore your pet to a good condition and continue to challenge
npc_70210_dialogue_2_4=Your pet looks so cute.
npc_70211_dialogue_2_4=Go ahead, you should be able to achieve the final victory.
npc_70212_dialogue_2_4=Your name will be engraved in the shrine by me.
npc_70301_dialogue_2_4=You are so strong, I will continue to work hard.
npc_70302_dialogue_2_4=You must fulfill your destiny, move on.
npc_70303_dialogue_2_4=I will become stronger.
npc_70304_dialogue_2_4=Come on, you can do it.
npc_70305_dialogue_2_4=......
npc_70306_dialogue_2_4=Wow, what an amazing fight.
npc_70307_dialogue_2_4=I will keep training hard.
npc_70308_dialogue_2_4=Good job, you can move on after defeating me.
npc_70309_dialogue_2_4=You should move on now.
npc_70310_dialogue_2_4=Maybe my training method is flawed.
npc_70311_dialogue_2_4=Unfortunately, I can only fight with you.
npc_70312_dialogue_2_4=Your name will be engraved in the shrine by me.
npc_70401_dialogue_2_4=Maybe the next person will beat you.
npc_70402_dialogue_2_4=I think my journey of training ends now.
npc_70403_dialogue_2_4=In the next battle, you need to be more calm.
npc_70404_dialogue_2_4=How come you have so much power in your tiny body?
npc_70405_dialogue_2_4=Don't worry, I won't feel sad.
npc_70406_dialogue_2_4=Boo hoo...I was beaten.
npc_70407_dialogue_2_4=It was a pleasure battling with you.
npc_70408_dialogue_2_4=I am really happy to battle you.
npc_70409_dialogue_2_4=I will keep training.
npc_70410_dialogue_2_4=Be careful, I may just beat you next time.
npc_70411_dialogue_2_4=Who would have thought? My life is such a joke...
npc_70412_dialogue_2_4=Your name will be engraved in the shrine by me.
