npc_60101_dialogue_3_1=You want to take the gold in the river? Don't even think about it.
npc_60102_dialogue_3_1=The gold is mine! Don't come near me!
npc_60103_dialogue_3_1=Hahaha! Nobody comes by here without carrying gold, don't run!
npc_60104_dialogue_3_1=Hey kid! Hand over all your belongings.
npc_60105_dialogue_3_1=We are now lacking manpower, you should stay.
npc_60106_dialogue_3_1=You want to buy something? I will not let you go before you buy anything.
npc_60107_dialogue_3_1=You want to take the gold from me? I will fight you to death!
npc_60108_dialogue_3_1=There are so many robbers recently, you look great, stay there!
npc_60109_dialogue_3_1=Young wanderer, are you interested in staying here and becoming our sheriff?
npc_60201_dialogue_3_1=Sigh...There are more and more robbers and gold miners, can you solve this problem?
npc_60202_dialogue_3_1=All the gold is in my bank.
npc_60203_dialogue_3_1=Sigh.. the people in this town is getting more and more greedy.
npc_60101_dialogue_2_4=Sorry, I misunderstood you.
npc_60102_dialogue_2_4=Sorry, I misunderstood you.
npc_60103_dialogue_2_4=Oh gosh, excuse me.
npc_60104_dialogue_2_4=You...wait for me, I will be back.
npc_60105_dialogue_2_4=I let you stay to make big money but you hit me, why......
npc_60106_dialogue_2_4=Sorry, I should not force you to buy.
npc_60107_dialogue_2_4=Sorry, I misunderstood you.
npc_60108_dialogue_2_4=Oh you are a visitor, my apologies.
npc_60109_dialogue_2_4=Sigh...It's a pity that you can't stay and protect us.
npc_60201_dialogue_2_4=Hmm, I wish our sheriff can be strong like you.
npc_60202_dialogue_2_4=What? Youngster, you wanna rob the bank?
npc_60203_dialogue_2_4=Gosh I really miss the old town.
