npc_60301_dialogue_3_1=Hi, please start your challenge.
npc_60302_dialogue_3_1=If you can beat the person before me, it means that you are quite strong. I'll have to go all out then.
npc_60303_dialogue_3_1=How am I sensing so much strength from a kid like you, interesting.
npc_60304_dialogue_3_1=Interesting little thing, let's battle!
npc_60305_dialogue_3_1=Hahaha, it's been a long time since anyone cleared the challenges to get to me.
npc_60307_dialogue_3_1=You are not bad, but sadly I will stop you right here.
npc_60309_dialogue_3_1=Seems like you are all ready! Let's go, defeat me to finish your challenge.
npc_60301_dialogue_2_4=You are so strong, I will train harder.
npc_60302_dialogue_2_4=Wow you are so strong! You can pass now.
npc_60303_dialogue_2_4=Not bad, seems like you do have potential to become a strong one.
npc_60304_dialogue_2_4=Hahaha you won! Go ahead you interesting kid.
npc_60305_dialogue_2_4=Hmmm, keep moving forward.
npc_60307_dialogue_2_4=I lost, you...can move forward.
npc_60309_dialogue_2_4=Good job youngster, keep it up! You will be the next big star.
npc_60306_dialogue_2_1=The handsome me will not accept your challenge.
npc_60308_dialogue_2_1=I only fight with my brother.
npc_60310_dialogue_2_1=Lalala...Only the captain can initiate team fights.
npc_50301_dialogue_3_1=Hi, are you ready to challenge?
npc_50302_dialogue_3_1=I try my hardest every time, bring it on.
npc_50303_dialogue_3_1=Hi challenger.
npc_50304_dialogue_3_1=I will improve myself through combat, bring it on!
npc_50305_dialogue_3_1=Boohoo...Hi there, are you here to challenge? Fine, make it quick I need to take a nap after this.
npc_50307_dialogue_3_1=I am invincible!
npc_50309_dialogue_3_1=Hahaha your challenge has just started, bring it on.
npc_50301_dialogue_2_4=Congratulations! Keep on moving.
npc_50302_dialogue_2_4=Sigh...the way I train is not enough.
npc_50303_dialogue_2_4=Come on, challenger.
npc_50304_dialogue_2_4=Thank you for letting me see the gap between you and me, I will train harder.
npc_50305_dialogue_2_4=Boohoo.... you passed, now I need to go back and take a nap.
npc_50307_dialogue_2_4=The unbeatable me, fell again!
npc_50309_dialogue_2_4=Keep it up youngster, there is a new journey ahead of you, keep moving.
npc_50306_dialogue_2_1=I only like battling, not talking to strangers.
npc_50308_dialogue_2_1=This is challenge time, I cannot talk to you.
npc_50310_dialogue_2_1=If you want to challenge someone go talk to my brother.
npc_40301_dialogue_3_1=Welcome to grass type gym.
npc_40302_dialogue_3_1=Hi little cutie pie, I accept your challenge.
npc_40303_dialogue_3_1=Hahaha, you have beaten them already, you are quite strong.
npc_40304_dialogue_3_1=My pets are all really cute, how about yours?
npc_40305_dialogue_3_1=Oh my apology I got distracted , let's start it.
npc_40307_dialogue_3_1=Hi there, are you ready to challenge me?
npc_40309_dialogue_3_1=Little kid this is the last challenge of your journey, try your best to beat me!
npc_40301_dialogue_2_4=Grass type pets are the cutest! Aren't they?
npc_40302_dialogue_2_4=Ah! I can't believe I lost to you.
npc_40303_dialogue_2_4=Wow You're really something! Keep going.
npc_40304_dialogue_2_4=Hahaha, even though you beat me, it doesn't change the fact that my pets are cuter.
npc_40305_dialogue_2_4=Hum! Move on to the next challenge!
npc_40307_dialogue_2_4=Great! Really energetic! Move on to the next challenge.
npc_40309_dialogue_2_4=Haha, you work really hard kid, keep it up.
npc_40306_dialogue_2_1=Lalala....K9 Reco is so cute.
npc_40308_dialogue_2_1=Wow! I really want a grass legendary pet.
npc_40310_dialogue_2_1=My grass type pet is going to bloom this morning, I am so excited.
